notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-06T20:43:07.766Z",pi-agent,"Evidence: Five actionable unknown-author events across two commit groups, all authored by Steve Preu <stefan@preu.at>.\n\nGroup 1 (_workspace lines 1-2): op config:set:governance.duplicate_detection_mode (ts 2026-07-25T23:13:19.743Z) and op config:set:parent_reference_policy (ts 2026-07-25T23:13:20.332Z). git log -S traced both to commit 2b6e834 'chore(governance): enable duplicate-detection advisory mode and restore parent_reference=warn (#41)'.\n\nGroup 2 (pm-brief-ce55 lines 1-3): op create (ts 2026-07-25T01:00:18.208Z), op note_add (ts 2026-07-25T01:00:25.795Z), and op close (ts 2026-07-25T01:00:26.204Z). git log -S traced all three to commit 141afa2 'chore(changelog): adopt --respect-item-release and bump pm-changelog to 2026.7.24 (#38)'.\n\nTwo separate append-only audit events were appended to _workspace.jsonl, one per group, each with its own commit SHA in the reason. Note: pm history-author-acknowledge has a regex bug that rejects _workspace (starts with _), so the SDK appendWorkspaceAuditEvent function was called directly to produce identical audit events."
tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds}:
  pm health --strict-exit,project,120
close_reason: Attribution acknowledged via two append-only audit events; pm health --strict-exit exits 0
